- Can you confirm your current medication list and doses (you mentioned apixaban 5 mg twice daily and metoprolol 25 mg — are there any other BP meds, blood thinners, iron supplements, or OTCs)?  
- Do you have recent BP readings at home (numbers and whether sitting/standing)?  
- What exactly did you mean by “last creatinine was 72%”? (Is that eGFR 72 mL/min/1.73m2, creatinine 0.72 mg/dL, or something else?)  
