- Any current symptoms: chest pain, palpitations, lightheadedness/syncope, shortness of breath, worsening exercise tolerance?  
- Any family history of early coronary disease, or other cardiac problems?

What to bring to the visit
- Full medication list (dose & schedule), including OTCs and supplements.  
- Records of home BP readings (date/time, seated/standing if available) — bring a week of readings if possible.  
- Recent labs or imaging reports (DXA, prior ECG/echocardiogram, recent creatinine/eGFR).  
