1) Quick clarifying questions
- Can you confirm your current medication list and exact doses/frequencies (apixaban dose, metoprolol dose and whether it’s once or twice daily, and any other meds or supplements)?
- Why are you on apixaban (atrial fibrillation, DVT/PE, other)?
