Good — I can help you get organized for the visit. I’ll cover clarifying questions I need, what to bring/which tests to request, focused questions to ask your PCP about hypertension, what would make a referral to cardiology appropriate, and suggested phrasing you can use with Dr. James Wilson. First a couple clarifying questions:

Quick clarifications
